  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7164</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4801</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>しっかし、&lt;Ines&gt;のって
バカデカイよな……
どうすればあんなに育つんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For real though, ain't &lt;Ines&gt;'s crazy huge?
Like how do you even get it that big?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7664</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4802</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>小さい頃は普通だったのに
成長期に急に大きくなっちゃって……
……自分の体ながら恥ずかしいわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was never like this as a kid, but as I
got older, it just kept on growing... It was
quite an embarrassing time, to be honest.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8384</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4803</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレ、服の上から
触らせてもらったけど
すっっっごくふくらんでたよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I got to feel through her clothes once,
and it was suuuuuper squishy!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9156</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4804</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>サイズだけでなく
形状、柔軟性、性能も
自分の記録中で最高のものだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is not only the size that is remarkable.
The form, suppleness and quality
are the highest among my records.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9544</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4805</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたくしのも、かなり
大きいみたいですけど
&lt;Ines&gt;にはかないませんわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And here I thought mine was
larger than average, yet I still
cannot hold a candle to &lt;Ines&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10132</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4806</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり
超〜〜〜大っきいよねぇ——</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's just sooooo stinkin' huge!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10876</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4807</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん、パイを十個も食べちゃう
&lt;Ines&gt;の胃袋は♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yep, it's quite the stomach
to fit ten whole pies in! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
